- **rec.io context:** `docs/pm_brain/11_external_ecosystem.md` — Kalshi section. Our touchpoints: `backend/trade_executor.py` (order execution, credentials, prod/demo base URLs), `backend/kalshi_account_sync_ws.py` (account history, WebSocket, v1/deposits/withdrawals), `backend/auto_entry_supervisor.py` (market/ticker usage), `backend/trade_manager.py` (order flow, status updates). Prod REST: `https://api.elections.kalshi.com/trade-api/v2`. Prod WebSocket: `wss://api.elections.kalshi.com/trade-api/ws/v2`. Demo: `https://demo-api.kalshi.co/trade-api/v2`. V1 base: `https://api.elections.kalshi.com`.

